  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'y'all wanna see a stupid post' because the phrase uses the inclusive 'y'all', which directly addresses the viewer as part of the audience. The user is invited to imagine themselves as part of the group reacting to the movie, and the text sets up the expectation that the user will be the one sharing or anticipating the 'stupid post'. The projection is onto the text, which acts as a direct address to the user.",
